#: ../../index.rst:6
msgid "**From bare-metal computer architecture to Generative AI — an educational 8-bit AVR RISC CPU simulator with real-time interactive visualization**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../index.rst:8
msgid "Tiny8 is a lightweight educational toolkit that bridges bare-metal computer architecture and modern Generative AI. Designed for hands-on learning and experimentation, it guides you through the full stack of computing — from 32 general-purpose registers, ALU operations, stack frames, and C compilation up to executing an iterative reverse-diffusion model synthesizing 28x28 MNIST digits directly on an AVR 8-bit RISC processor. With an interactive Vim-inspired terminal debugger, time-travel reverse execution, and a 32x32 TrueColor memory heatmap, Tiny8 lets you see, step through, and understand computation at every level."
msgstr ""

